ate-out asks four · §2 step 4 plans four lenses · §6.3 directs four runs, against legs 4–5's five — a separate instruction-layer deferral, RUN §9) · guards.md:28 still promises the five-lens form 'will demonstrate at the next wave' though it demonstrated at Wave 33 (T192 PASS) · the observe-exit call's RETURN basis at 0.5, FED-list form, and full-mechanics-credit evidence standard all stand open — RUN §9b.3; all named NOT-YET-AMENDED in RUN §9/§9b with consumer + reason; the stamp corrected at condense firing 14 under INSTRUCTION's own definition — COMPLETE requires hosted AND current — the count corrected at firing 16 (codex-observe.md's line 25 supersedes its line-24 sentence: current, not stale) and the basis extended at firings 17 + 22 + 23). Codex-condense: 27 verdict-bearing returns (firings 1–27, all REVISE, all applied in the cycle record) + 1 truncated stream; the re-fire loop itself recorded in RUN §9b.6(b) as a variance with authority unresolved against the definition's 'One run per cycle' line — definition question deferred to the next guard-editing Condense; ACCEPT pending the final firing, whose return files in the run dir — an earlier draft of this entry printed the ACCEPT before the return existed and stands corrected."
